  "description": "Entity Framework Core session store for Vali-Blob resumable uploads.\n        Implements IResumableUploadStore backed by any EF Core-compatible database (SQL Server, PostgreSQL, SQLite, etc.),\n        enabling persistent tracking of multipart / chunked upload sessions across Vali-Blob providers.\n        Includes a ready-to-use DbContext, migration support, and DI registration helpers.\n        Targets net8.0 and net9.0 (EF Core 9 requires .NET 8+).",
